# Intelligence on a workstation, activated in place of newspack-intelligence:
# the same core, with Slack, P2 and Linear read through ContextA8C
# (newspack-intelligence-context-a8c) in place of the Vault-credentialed
# token half, and the public sources and Unthread, which ContextA8C cannot
# read, as shipped.
var on_demand_idle = 0
# Stays 600 until a measured run shows a lower value is safe: a pass still
# holds work across ticks.
var stale_timeout = 600
var num_partitions = 1
include newspack-intelligence-core
include newspack-intelligence-collect-public
include newspack-intelligence-context-a8c
include newspack-intelligence-collect-unthread
# Last, so the site's lines reach every node above.
include newspack-intelligence-deployment
# Six feeds at once: a workstation's Docker resolver fails lookups at sixteen.
cmd feed:config set_concurrency 6
secure
